{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06048","headline":"恭懿太子挽歌五首 三 · 王维","name":"恭懿太子挽歌五首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"骑吹凌霜发，旌旗夹路陈。\n凯容金节护，册命玉符新。\n傅母悲香褓，君家拥画轮。\n射熊今梦帝，秤象问何人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06048.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06048","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}